{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>無綫處境劇《愛·回家之三代同糖》昨晚（2日）播出的最新一集中，由何依婷飾演的「拜金女」朱圓圓再度成為焦點。何依婷在劇中將精明醒目、帶有公主病及對愛情極有主見的港女形象演得活靈活現。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_d6b6f4e64500debf-141\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>劇情講到，朱圓圓因家中爆水喉而迫於無奈到唐家「避難」。唐萬里（吳若希飾）好奇問她為何不入住酒店，朱圓圓坦言因剛買了名貴手袋而導致手頭緊。面對唐萬里提議她應作正經投資而非豪買手袋時，朱圓圓隨即理直氣壯地爆出拜金金句：「投資喺我自己身上，靚樣、靚衫、靚袋、靚鞋，咪最好嘅投資？」將愛美至上的港女價值觀發揮得淋漓盡致，令對方頓時無言以對。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_d6b6f4e64500debf-141\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"aa26c7fc-00b4-4d3f-b81e-1f38fea1cda6.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026jmoT92EFGP1788426792.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"aa26c7fc-00b4-4d3f-b81e-1f38fea1cda6.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_d6b6f4e64500debf-142\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>在其後唐芯（李茵彤飾）的提議下，朱圓圓暫住由唐嘉聰（李偉健飾）負責營運的開心小棧。入住後的她徹底大放「公主病」，將唐嘉聰當作免費管家般瘋狂指使，提出各種極為苛刻的要求：</span></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p id=\"p-rc_d6b6f4e64500debf-143\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>「你哋冇room service㗎？」</span></p></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p id=\"p-rc_d6b6f4e64500debf-144\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>「幫我準備毛巾啦！」</span></p></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p id=\"p-rc_d6b6f4e64500debf-145\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>「一次性毛巾點用呀？」</span></p></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p id=\"p-rc_d6b6f4e64500debf-148\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>「我依家肚餓，想食早餐。」</span></p></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p id=\"p-rc_d6b6f4e64500debf-149\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>「我買咗兩箱消脂茶，聽日幫我攞上嚟。」</span></p></li></ul><p id=\"p-rc_d6b6f4e64500debf-150\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>除了日常呼喝，當大廈升降機故障時，她更心安理得地要求唐嘉聰落樓提宵夜：「舅父，我頭先叫咗宵夜，但嗰lift壞咗呀，你落去幫我攞呀！你諗吓，我一個女仔萬一有咩事⋯⋯」最荒謬的是，她為了晾衫竟然霸佔男廁不讓其他人使用，還理直氣壯地反駁：「樓上有冷氣機，滴水滴到我啲衫度，係咪你賠先？」</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4f329254-b6c4-4d2f-856c-aa4b9783f6b3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026XycBwZQZV11788426792.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4f329254-b6c4-4d2f-856c-aa4b9783f6b3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"77a965c3-1e10-445a-81d6-f533ab36e78f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Ci2J68bBUb1788426792.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"77a965c3-1e10-445a-81d6-f533ab36e78f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_d6b6f4e64500debf-151\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>面對朱圓圓連串的無理要挾，不堪重負的唐嘉聰最終忍不住向家人訴苦，誰知過程不幸被當事人當場捉包。朱圓圓隨即秒速變臉，切換成委屈的「可憐mode」詐型：「你做咩咁話我？有咩唔滿意，我最多去改，你唔使喺背後咁學是學 - 學非嘅。」氣得唐嘉聰啞口無言。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_d6b6f4e64500debf-152\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>隨後劇情發展更添喜劇感，朱圓圓帶唐嘉聰挑選家具時，意外撞見曾熱烈追求過她的富二代及其新女伴。為了保住面子與尊嚴，她硬逼唐嘉聰假扮現任男友擋駕。期間朱圓圓更直言對方只是個每月領取家族基金、甚至要求她婚後生足「六個仔」的富二代，並清醒地吐露心聲：「你哋男人揀女人都想揀一個又靚又聽話又肯幫你生仔嘅，我哋女人揀男人就想揀一個有修養有上進心靠自己努力嘅。」展現出極為務實的一面，讓不少觀眾看後深感共鳴。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T09:40:08.363556+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":881,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}